5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to ensure our reporting is transparent. I'll look into independent checks on holdings' reported figures and appraisal needs at the last audit.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about our capacity to support these teams. I'll check retained recruiters' placement times and adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I would like to see the reality of our customer loyalty. I'll examine account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to understand our financial flexibility. I will review reserve accounts and follow-on calls and the terms of last winter's credit line.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I want to identify the bottlenecks in deployment. I'll look into security review time before first deployment and delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
