25,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems hardware and depots complicate our audits, adding both time and cost. However, they provide data we can actually verify independently.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"We have a surplus of software board capacity, but our recruiters are struggling to find operational supervisors and field crews.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Our successful exits were quiet back-office financial tools. Interestingly, the tool for independent practices showed very strong retention.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Our reserves are being drained by follow-on calls faster than expected, and our credit line doesn't value subscription contracts.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Security reviews for medical or financial data are significantly slower. Also, custom hardware has caused major delivery delays.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Misaki, if the credit line ignores subscriptions, we should be wary of models relying solely on that for security.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, does the hardware delay apply to all devices, or just specific types of assembly?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, the fact that hardware allows for independent verification is a comforting thought for our reporting.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, you are right. We need a company that doesn't trigger immediate, unbacked borrowing or heavy reserve calls.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, it was a controller shortage for a company assembling its own devices. Pure software in a bank cycle was seamless.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, if we can't find field crews, any company requiring seasonal labor is a massive risk.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Exactly, Mizuki. We are well-equipped for software boards, but empty on logistics expertise.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, if medical records cause a three-quarter delay, we should consider the timing of our first deployment carefully.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, the back-office financial tools you mentioned as successful exits might be the safest path.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, I agree. Avoiding both medical security hurdles and hardware assembly seems logical.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
