50,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The candidates are A: Clinic Scheduler, B: Ledger Bridge, C: Fabric Loop, and D: Harvest Sensor. I lean toward B.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,B is software-based and doesn't require the field crews or supervisors that I found are impossible to recruit.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Shizue,,B fits the profile of our successful back-office exits and likely avoids the retention issues seen in other sectors.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Misaki,,B avoids the hardware appraisal fees Mizuki mentioned and doesn't rely on the risky follow-on patterns of physical assets.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Shion,,"A has security delays, C and D have hardware and logistics risks. B is the most efficient path to deployment.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Misaki, would B's subscription model be a problem for the credit line?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Even if it is, it's better than the recruitment nightmare of C or D.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, the stability of the product is more important than the credit line's specific security terms.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, as long as it doesn't require heavy upfront equipment costs, it's manageable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Shion,,B is the only one that avoids all the red flags we've identified.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. B is the most stable choice for our current reporting and staffing situation.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'm voting for B.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I concur. B is the most sensible.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I support B.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Shion,,B is the logical choice.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
